lena_hernandez92   # WC 2026: The Summer We'll Never Shut Up About

I'll probably never be in a host city again for a World Cup, and it's been one of the best experiences of my life. The streets, the flags, the singing, random strangers hugging after goals. I don't want it to end. Mexico fue increíble. Gracias por todo. 🇲🇽❤️